// NodeControlService is the orchestrator-side control plane for
// `daft-sandboxd serve`. A Node opens a single outbound mTLS
// connection to the orchestrator and:
//
//   1. calls RegisterNode with its capacity advertisement,
//      holding the server-streamed channel open for the lifetime
//      of the sandboxd process. The first event is a SubscriptionReady;
//      subsequent events push Sandbox lifecycle changes down.
//   2. emits Heartbeat unaries on a fixed interval so the
//      orchestrator's registry can mark Nodes dead when the
//      heartbeats stop.
//
// Caller identity for every RPC is the mTLS leaf-cert fingerprint
